// 005.12 (D35, #51): `Prohibited`, `Forbidden when`, and `Void when`.
Fact person Identified by Agent, Principal
Bool consented
Bool mixed
Prohibited mix-funds Actor person Recipient person'
  Unless consented()
  Creates mixed()
Power self-deal Actor person
  Valid when person == Agent
  Forbidden when !consented()
  Void when !consented()
  Creates mixed()
.
?!lawful mix-funds(Agent, Principal).
?valid mix-funds(Agent, Principal).
?!lawful self-deal(Agent).
?!valid self-deal(Agent).
+consented().
?lawful mix-funds(Agent, Principal).
?lawful self-deal(Agent).
?valid self-deal(Agent).
